  "releaseNotes": "NextGenSoftware.OASIS.API.Providers.RedisOASIS v2.0.3\n\nRedis OASIS Provider — high-performance in-memory key-value store for OASIS holons and avatars via StackExchange.Redis. https://oasisomniverse.one\n\nWhat's new since v2.0.2\n- Consolidate Redis-compatible providers on shared SDK and record policy (bf3e8cd)\n- feat(redis): add verified native conditional storage adapter (5c6bcf5)\n- feat(redis): reuse shared encrypted storage lifecycle with native proof (4e55817)\n- fix(providers): checkpoint Redis codec and NEAR transfer signers (a321b3a)\n- MOVING DOCS AROUND (32a8004)\n- Recover Redis and SQL Server CQL launchers with canonical key dependency (7639a82)\n- refactor: share Redis state comparison rules for REST providers (7eca05a)\n- Validate GUID native keys before avatar deletion in forty adapters (597758b)\n\nFull changelog\nhttps://github.com/NextGenSoftwareUK/OASIS/commits/master/Providers/Storage/NextGenSoftware.OASIS.API.Providers.RedisOASIS",
